{"actor": "unknown-agent", "data": {"documentation_gaps": {}, "duration_s": 1457.2, "landed_paths": 0, "missing_artifacts": 0, "next": "Verify the CI run on 50271e5: the probe's seven annotations, and that the rebase-merge branch of landrebase.orig_head is exercised for the first time on the runner's git 2.55.0. STATE-defects.md and FAILURES-findings-4.md are at 299 and 297, and STATE-defects.md cannot be split inside its numbered list without defectlist.py reading more than one file.", "outcome": "worked", "push_requested": false, "summary": "Made sync land's own conflict instruction executable: it completes a rebase it stopped on once no path is still conflicted, and reads the pre-rebase tip from git's own orig-head so the arrival is recorded and the base's paths are not attributed to the session that resolved the conflict. Both halves falsified against the unmodified code. Also closed T-0046's stated gap by capturing arm E: the probe ran on its first pushed run (37196459285), filed all seven shapes, and answered what four runs of reading could not - including line= fidelity and a warning level carrying file=. 489 tests green, preflight OK.", "unlogged_changes": 0}, "host": "instance-20260717-0944", "kind": "session_end", "schema": "origin.session.event/1", "seq": 49, "session": "2026-10-04-030-make-sync-land-s-own-conflict-instructio", "ts": "2026-10-04T11:13:19+00:00"}
